Built-Using: ${misc:Built-Using},
Description: Self-hosted photo and video management solution - ML CPU backend
 Easily back up, organize, and manage your photos on your own server. immich
 helps you browse, search and organize your photos and videos with ease,
 without sacrificing your privacy.
 .
 This package contains the prebuilt CPU inference backend of the machine
 learning server, also used for ARM NN.

Package: immich-machine-learning-cuda
Architecture: amd64
Depends: immich-machine-learning (= ${source:Version}),
         ${ml:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Conflicts: immich-machine-learning-backend,
Replaces: immich-machine-learning-backend,
Provides: immich-machine-learning-backend (= ${binary:Version}),
Built-Using: ${misc:Built-Using},
Description: Self-hosted photo and video management solution - ML CUDA backend
 Easily back up, organize, and manage your photos on your own server. immich
 helps you browse, search and organize your photos and videos with ease,
 without sacrificing your privacy.
 .
 This package contains the prebuilt NVIDIA CUDA inference backend of the
 machine learning server. It requires the CUDA 12 runtime and cuDNN 9
 libraries.
 .
 It is provided as is: the hardware-accelerated backends cannot be tested
 by the maintainer.

